## **6. Monitoring Tools**

| Tool          | Purpose                          |
| ------------- | -------------------------------- |
| Prometheus    | Collects and stores metrics      |
| Grafana       | Visualizes metrics in dashboards |
| Node Exporter | Exposes Linux system metrics     |
| Alertmanager  | Manages and routes alerts        |

