## **8. Example Production Alert Thresholds**

| Metric      | Warning | Critical |
| ----------- | ------- | -------- |
| CPU         | 85%     | 95%      |
| Memory      | 85%     | 95%      |
| Disk        | 80%     | 90%      |
| Packet loss | 1%      | 2%       |

*These are example thresholds. Actual thresholds depend on workload and infrastructure.*

**Remember:** Monitoring helps DevOps engineers identify resource bottlenecks, troubleshoot performance issues, prevent downtime and maintain application availability.
